 ## What linux-thox is
 
-linux-thox is the kernel ThoxOS Core runs. It is a Linux LTS fork,
-licensed GPL-2.0-only, and it is deliberately *not* a new kernel: the
-THOX delta on top of upstream Linux is a readable patch series plus
